<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-RAIN BRINGS PREMATURE END TO SRI LANKA MATCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-RAIN BRINGS PREMATURE END TO SRI LANKA MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-08-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The one-day match between Sri Lanka and a World XI was abandoned on Saturday because of rain.</p>
<p>Scores: World XI 102-0 (M.Waugh 39 not out, S.Tendulkar 56 not out) off 21.4 overs v Sri Lanka.</p>
</text>
